{{fbdoc item="title" value="__FB_SOLARIS__"}}----

{{fbdoc item="syntax"}}
	""__FB_SOLARIS__""

{{fbdoc item="desc"}}
	Define without a value created at compile time when the Solaris target is
	being used.

	The compiler also defines ##**__FB_SOLARIS__**## for the illumos target as
	a Solaris-family compatibility symbol.  Use ##[[KeyPgDdfbillumos|__FB_ILLUMOS__]]## when code must detect illumos specifically.

{{fbdoc item="ex"}}
%%(freebasic)
#IFDEF __FB_SOLARIS__
	print "Solaris-family target"
#ENDIF
%%

{{fbdoc item="back" value="CatPgDddefines|Predefined Defines"}}
{{fbdoc item="see"}}
	[[KeyPgDdfbillumos|__FB_ILLUMOS__]]
